{"version":1,"content":"<p>台灣樂團告五人昨日（7日）在台北小巨蛋舉辦「在這裡＠century」世界巡迴演唱會第2場演出，邀得女神莫文蔚驚喜現身擔任嘉賓，樂團女主音犬青直言前一晚又緊張又興奮，為此失眠。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;莫文蔚先跟告五人合唱《</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.565330+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T16:01:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.769706+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.769706+00:00","content_hash":"34f5fbc21e5941d5ce92f2d67886d5a2a5a9daf11c8c0805f6196544b7d72921","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}